          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yagambira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kandi bara batabani ba Geresooni omu bika byabo n'omu bitabu ebya baisenkurubo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abanyakuhikize emyaka asatu okugarukira ha myaka ataano ey'obukuru, obale boona abasobora kutaaha omu buheereza, kukora omulimo omu Heema ey'okutangatanganiramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gunu nugwo omulimo ab'ebika by'Abageresooni ogubaraakoraga kandi binu nibyo ebintu ebi baraayetwekaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahimbege enkingyo z'enju ya MUKAMA n'Eheema ey'okutangatanganiramu, hamu n'ekisweeko kyayo kandi n'ekisweeko eky'empu ez'engonge ekinyakuli ha ruguru yakyo, n'orukingyo orw'Eheema ey'okutangatanganiramu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "engoye zoona ez'okutimba omu zigati, orukingyo rw'irembo ery'ezigati enyakwehinguliriize enju ya MUKAMA n'itambiro, obuhuuzo obw'engoye ezi n'ebintu byona ebinyakuzikoraho, kandi bakole kyona ekirukwetagwa kuzikoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emirimo yoona eya batabani ba Geresooni, eragirwege Arooni n'abatabani, byona ebi baraabaga nibaija kuhimba, na byona ebi baraabaga nibaija kukora. Kandi niwe orabaragira ebibarayetwekaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu nugwo omulimo ogw'ebika ebya batabani ba Geresooni omu Heema ey'okutangatanganiramu, kandi omulimo gwabo, guraaroleererwaga Itamara mutabani wa Arooni nyakatagara.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
