          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi batabani ba Merali obabale omu bika byabo n'omu bitabu ebya baisenkurubo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obale abo boona abanyakuli hagati y'emyaka amakumi asatu okuhika ha myaka ataano, buli muntu arukusobora kutaaha omu mulimo ogw'obuheereza, kukora omulimo ogw'Eheema ey'okutangatanganiramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gunu nugwo omulimo ogu baraakwasibwa kukora, nubo baraakoraga omulimo gwona, omu Heema ey'okutangatanganiramu. Barayetwakaga embaaho ez'enju ya MUKAMA hamu n'emigamba yayo, enyomyo n'obucuba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enyomyo ez'ezigati enyakwehinguliriize, n'obucuba bwazo, enkondo n'obuguha hamu n'ebikwato byazo byona, n'ebindi byona ebinyakwetagwaho kandi iwe okwase buli muntu ebintu ebirukwetaagwa kwetweka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu nugwo omulimo ogw'ebika ebya batabani ba Merali, gwona mulimo gwabo, kukora omu Heema ey'okutangatanganiramu, nibaroleererwa Itamara mutabani wa Arooni nyakatagara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
