              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu nugwo gukaba guli muhendo ogw'ebika eby'Abakohati boona abaakozire omu Heema ey'okutangatanganiramu, Musa na Arooni nubo baabazire nkooku MUKAMA yaragiire Musa.",
