              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu nugwo gwabaire omuhendo ogw'ebika ebya batabani ba Geresooni, boona abaakozire omulimo omu Heema ey'okutangatanganiramu, abaabazirwe Musa na Arooni nkooku MUKAMA yaragiire. ",
          "type": "text",
