            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo nubo baabazirwe omu bika ebya batabani ba Merali, Musa na Arooni aba baabazire nibahondera MUKAMA ebi yaragiire Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
