              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo boona abaabazirwe omu Baleevi, Musa na Arooni, abeebembezi aba ba Isirairi, omu bika byabo n'omu bitabu ebya baisenkurubo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
